00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:06.810
 『Reika Winding Up』

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:06.810
 『Reika Winding Up』

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.710
<b>It's already morning.</b>

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:18.380
<b>I have to prepare breakfast.</b>

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:25.090
<b>This messy hair is gonna take a while to fix.</b>

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:31.180
<b>You definitely can't show that hair to Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.630
<b>What nonsense are you saying?</b>

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:38.640
<b>I don't really care about that guy.</b>

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:44.110
<b>Besides, for an attendant, you sure have a lot to say.</b>

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:50.820
<b>Why is there a need for me to be interested in him?</b>

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:58.920
<b>Looks like your hair setting is done again today, Ojou-sama.</b>

