00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Episode 3

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Let's Go To Town

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Episode 3

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Let's Go To Town

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.570
<b>Please don't get the wrong idea.</b>

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:57.790
<b>That was just a greeting. Something like that.</b>

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.920
<b>This is natural and normal overseas.</b>

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:04.740
<b>But...</b>

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:07.250
<b>That was my first time.</b>

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.210
<b>So, please take the responsibility.</b>

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.340
<b>I will.</b>

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:26.940
<b>That was...</b>

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:32.480
<b>Ninomiya-kun, I...</b>

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:35.530
<b>Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:37.820
<b>Please, hold me!</b>

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.990
<b>No, wait, it's too sudden!</b>

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:42.160
<b>Cut!</b>

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:44.240
<b>Hey, Shungo.</b>

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.240
<b>Why are you refusing to do the training?</b>

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:53.790
<b>If you don't take this seriously, I'll chain you down to a mysterious corpse, with only a saw in a bathroom.</b>

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.500
<b>Naked!</b>

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.170
<b>Was that training just now?</b>

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:02.760
<b>I'm sorry. I'll try harder next time. Let me do it one more time.</b>

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.600
<b>That's my Nee-san{sister}.</b>

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:10.020
<b>I feel you're getting better everyday, Mayu-chan.</b>

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:13.560
<b>Let's start with the next training.</b>

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.070
<b>Here I go!</b>

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:22.570
<b>Okay, bring it on.</b>

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.340
<b>Ninomiya-kun!</b>

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.630
<b>I told you to break all of them by hugging him, didn't I?</b>

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.260
<b>Man!</b>

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.690
<b>Very well, on to the next training.</b>

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:50.650
<b>I can't take this anymore.</b>

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.850
<b>My patience is at its limit.</b>

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:57.530
<b>Wait, that's really a bad idea.</b>

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.370
<b>Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.780
<b>If it's you, then...</b>

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.740
<b>this isn't much to ask for...</b>

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.580
<b>Tsukimura-san, you can't do that!</b>

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.910
<b>Tsukimura Mayu!</b>

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.540
<b>Will you cut it out―</b>

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:42.150
<b>Every morning, you do these shameless, meaningless, lewd acts.</b>

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:45.860
<b>What are you saying? This is training!</b>

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.910
<b>It's not meaningless!</b>

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.120
<b>I wonder about that.</b>

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.790
<b>It's pointless even if you continue.</b>

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:56.160
<b>It's okay. I'll beat men.</b>

00:05:56.160 --> 00:06:00.000
<b>Anything can be done as long as you put in effort.</b>

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.000
<b>What do you think, Ninomiya-kun?</b>

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:02.420
<b>Eh!</b>

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.630
<b>What do you think of the situation?</b>

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.550
<b><i>I don't have the skill to calm my emotions.</i></b>

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.160
<b>I bought a cell phone.</b>

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.360
<b>Ah, me too.</b>

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.690
<b>Eh, comeon show it to us.</b>

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.690
<b>Where is it?</b>

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:32.830
<b>Hey, forget about that guy.</b>

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:35.160
<b>You should hang out with us.</b>

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.330
<b>No...</b>

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.250
<b>Again?</b>

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.830
<b>Hi, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:46.420
<b>You're just too much. You already have us.</b>

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.970
<b>You've been sticking around Tsukimura-san all this while.</b>

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:53.140
<b>It's not fair.</b>

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.810
<b>Please let me through.</b>

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:03.150
<b>Since when did Ninomiya Shungo-kun become someone's property?</b>

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:07.150
<b>Ayakawa-san, my relationship with Tsukimura-san is just...</b>

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.360
<b>Excuse me, everyone.</b>

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:19.160
<b>Ninomiya-kun is always very busy at home. But, despite that, he always helps me out.</b>

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.710
<b>So, please, I'm begging you all.</b>

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.170
<b>Please don't...</b>

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:30.420
<b>Who cares about Ninomiya?</b>

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.970
<b>Have some fun with us, Mayu-chan.</b>

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:52.700
<b>That wench may be firm with me, but in front of men she's hopeless.</b>

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.990
<b>I just got a great idea.</b>

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:00.700
<b>A wonderful idea to make that wench admit defeat!</b>

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.710
<b>I have a bad feeling about this.</b>

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.930
<b>Tsukimura-san, shall we go home?</b>

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:14.640
<b>Sure.</b>

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:15.690
<b>Excuse me.</b>

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:19.480
<b>I'm deeply sorry for interrupting your conversation.</b>

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:21.190
<b>Okushiro-san?</b>

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:23.740
<b>Okushiro-san?</b>

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:29.330
<b>Well, she's in the organising committee with me for the field trip.</b>

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.490
<b>I'm Okushiro Irori.</b>

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:32.990
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:36.990
<b>Ah, h-hello. I'm Tsukimura Mayu.</b>

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.870
<b>What is it? Did you need something?</b>

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:45.710
<b>Yeah. It's regarding the field trip.
I'd like to borrow some of your time.</b>

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:48.390
<b>You mean right now?</b>

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:50.220
<b>Yes, right now.</b>

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:56.560
<b>Sorry, Tsukimura-san. I'll try to finish earlier. So, please wait for me a bit.</b>

00:08:57.190 --> 00:08:58.900
<b>Okay, I understand.</b>

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.860
<b>I'll be all right, so please go on ahead.</b>

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:05.900
<b>Well then, Ninomiya-san, this way please.</b>

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.700
<b>Say, Tsukimura-san.</b>

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.910
<b>I'd like you to come with me for a bit.</b>

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.250
<b>Me?</b>

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:38.590
<b>Okushiro-san.</b>

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.680
<b>What was it you needed me for anyway?</b>

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:50.400
<b>This is the itinerary for the field trip. I got it from the teacher.</b>

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:52.620
<b>Ah, I see.</b>

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:00.210
<b>Is that all?</b>

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:01.330
<b>Yes.</b>

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.200
<b>You could have just passed it to me in the classroom.</b>

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:05.750
<b>Ah, that's true.</b>

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.630
<b>How silly of me.</b>

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.730
<b>I'll be excusing myself then.</b>

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:27.570
<b>That sure was fun.</b>

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:32.410
<b>What was up with her?</b>

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:41.170
<b>You shouldn't be running in the hallway, Shungo-kun.</b>

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.170
<b>Why are you here?</b>

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:49.300
<b>I took a job today to do some routine duties here to kill time.</b>

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:51.760
<b>I'm doing my rounds around the campus now.</b>

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:55.720
<b>By the way, Mayu isn't here anymore.</b>

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.760
<b>She went out with a friend.</b>

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.760
<b>That reminds me.</b>

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:07.980
<b>If anything were to happen to my Nee-san{sister}, I'll make your life a living hell.</b>

